<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">Notes:   (a) The above Standalone &amp; Consolidated Financial Results of the Company for the qtr &amp; half yr ended 30/09/2021 have been reviewed &amp; recommended by the Audit Committee &amp; approved by the Board of Directors of the Company in their respective meetings held on 10/11/2021.The Statutory Auditors of the Company have reviewed these results as required under Reg 33 of the SEBI LODR Regulations,2015   (b) The financial Accounts of Bengal Emami Housing Ltd, Swan Housing &amp; Infra Pvt. Ltd &amp; Prajay Urban Pvt. Ltd, associates of the Company &amp; Lohitka Properties LLP, Mumbai in which the Company is 10% partner, not being ready have not been taken into consolidated results for the qtr &amp; half yr ended 30/09/2021 &amp; the impact thereof has been judged as non-material   (c) The Company has assessed possible effects that may result from the pandemic COVID-19 on the carrying amount of Receivables, Inventories, Investments and other assets/liabilities. Based on the internal &amp; external sources of information, the Company is of the view that as on date of approval of these financial results, the impact of COVID-19 is not material. However, the impact assessment of COVID-19 is a continuing process given its nature and duration. The Company will continue to closely observe the evolving scenario and take into account any future developments arising out of the same.    (d) The Demerger Committee of Board of Directors at their meeting held on 15/09/2021 has allotted 9905000 equity shares pursuant to Scheme of Arrangement (Demerger) between the Company &amp; Oriental Sales Agencies (India) Pvt. Ltd sanctioned by the Hon'ble NCLT at Kolkata Bench vide Order dated 10/08/2021. Pursuant to this allotment, equity share capital of Company has increased from Rs558.78 Lakhs to Rs756.88 Lakhs. The Company has received listing &amp; trading approval from BSE &amp; NSE with respect to these shares   (e) The effect of the abovesaid Scheme has not been given in the result for the quarter ended 30/06/2021 which was approved by Board of Directors in its Board meeting held on 10/08/2021, the same has been taken in the Financials for the quarter ended 30/09/2021.The figures for corresponding previous quarter and half-year ended 30/09/2020 has not been changed since the effect of the abovesaid Scheme has been taken in the results for the financial year ended 31/03/2021   (f) The Company operates in a single business segment i.e. Real Estate Development   (g) These Financial Results are available on Company's website at http://www.emamirealty.com   (h) Figures of previous periods have been regrouped/recasted, wherever necessary          Trade Payables:   Total outstanding dues of Micro Enterprises and Small Enterprises – Rs. 8.96 Lakhs     Total outstanding dues of creditors other than Micro Enterprises and Small Enterprises – Rs. 567.82 Lakhs   Total – Rs. 576.78 Lakhs      Notes to Cash Flow Statement    Cash flows from used in operating activities     (Rs.in lakhs)   Other adjustments for which cash effects are investing or financing cash flow:    Profit on sale of Units of Mutual Funds      (27.07)   Total          (27.07)   Other inflows (outflows) of cash:   Current Tax Assets (Net)       (213.53)   Cash flows from used in investing activities   Other inflows (outflows) of cash:   Sale of units of Mutual Funds       7,827.07    Purchase of units of Mutual Funds      (7,800)   Investments in Non-Current Investments     (57.00)   Investments in Current Investments                                                                                (3,893.51)   (Investments in)/ Proceeds from Fixed Deposit     259.06   Purchase of Minority Interest                                                                                            (3.38)   Total          (3,667.76)</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
